<title>USA: Oxford Health Plans rates to rise in 1997.</title>
<headline>Oxford Health Plans rates to rise in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>NORWALK, Conn 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Health Care Financing Administration will raise Oxford Health Plans Inc's weighted average premium rate in three states including New York at the beginning of next year, Oxford said Monday.</p>
<p>The company said the administration will raise by 1.10 percent the rate in New York, 6.92 percent in New Jersey and 4.93 percent in Conneticut on January 1.</p>
<p>Oxford administers employer-funded benefit health plans, among other services.</p>
